<div class="mp-proof-grid">{% for item in proofCases %}<article class="mp-case"><p class="mp-label">{{ item.sector }}</p><p class="mp-case-number">{{ item.number }}</p><h3>{{ item.label }}</h3><p class="mp-case-result">{{ item.result }}</p><p>{{ item.detail }}</p><a href="{{ item.href }}">{{ item.link }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>{% endfor %}</div><p class="mp-proof-note">Past campaign results, with the stated timeframes. Client identities are withheld. New outcomes depend on the offer, audience, data and sales follow-through.</p>
